&CONTROL CMS
&ERROR &EXIT &RETCODE

EXAMPLE1 1234 5678
&TYPE Did it print 1234 + 5678 => 6912 ?

EXAMPLE2 100000 6.5 20
&BEGTYPE
Did it print 100000 at 6.5% for 20 years => 352364.51 ?
&END

EXAMPLE3 100000 6.5 20
&BEGTYPE
Did it print 100000 at 6.5% for 20 years => 352364.51 ?
&END

EXAMPLE4 1234 5678
&TYPE Did it print 1234 + 5678 => 6912 ?

EXAMPLE5 79
&TYPE Did it print 79 => 22 38 00 00 00 00 00 79 => 79 ?

EXAMPLE6 100000 6.5 20
&BEGTYPE
Did it print Result: 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 03 52 36 45 1c (scale=2) ?
&END

EXAMPLE7 1234 5678
&TYPE Did it print 1234 + 5678 => 6912 ?

EXAMPLE8  10 5
&BEGTYPE
Did it print power(2*10, 5) => 3200000
&END
